<main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST VISIT</p><h1>Visit Avon Toastmasters<br><em>in Christchurch.</em></h1><p class="lead">The best way to understand Toastmasters is to experience a meeting. Come as a guest, meet our members and see what happens.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap visit-grid"><div class="visit-main"><p class="eyebrow blue">YOU ARE INVITED</p><h2>Come along and<br><em>see for yourself.</em></h2><p class="large">You do not need to book a speech, prepare anything or decide whether to join before you arrive.</p><p>Let us know you are interested and we can help you find the next meeting. If plans change, please check the official club listing for the latest details.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="mailto:hello@toastmasters.net.nz?subject=Visiting%20Avon%20Toastmasters">Email the club <span>→</span></a><p class="muted">Email: <a href="mailto:hello@toastmasters.net.nz">hello@toastmasters.net.nz</a><br>Thomas – VPPR · <a href="tel:+64276084338">0276084338</a></p><p><a class="arrow-link" href="/faq.html">Have a question? Visit our FAQs →</a></p></div><aside class="visit-card"><p class="eyebrow">MEETING DETAILS</p><h3>Avon Toastmasters</h3><p><b>When</b><br>First, second and fourth Tuesdays<br>7:00 pm</p><p><b>Where</b><br>St Albans Community Centre<br>1049 Colombo Street<br>St Albans, Christchurch 8014</p><a class="arrow-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=St+Albans+Community+Centre+1049+Colombo+Street+Christchurch">Directions to meeting venue ↗</a><p><b>Car parking</b><br>126 Caledonian Road, Christchurch</p><a class="arrow-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=126+Caledonian+Road+Christchurch">Directions to car parking ↗</a></aside></div></section></main>